      "message": "fix(motion): refuse Arc on an Outside ring pass with no air room\n\nReview rework of #3899 (the maintainer's rule on #3741: an Outside pass\ngoes down in air outside the stock, never by a helix or ramp entry).\n\n- A selected Arc on an Outside ring pass (Waterline, Offset rings) with\n  no air room is refused by name before the ladder runs:\n  OUTSIDE_AIR_REFUSAL. No automatic ramp or helix is posted.\n- The #3748 advice note of a selected Helix, Ramp or Plunge is written on\n  each Inside or Outside ring pass, with or without the air room.\n- The pins: the band pocket with no stock refuses Arc; Plunge and Ramp\n  run as selected with exactly one warning.\n\nRefs #3884\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
